# docs/v3/INDEX.md (the docs index, with the generated As of, Next and review-debt lines) and
# docs/v3/audit.jsonl (the ledger's index) are built, never committed (S156; owner, 2026-11-20:
# "Stop committing them (Recommended)"), so a checkout rebuilds them from the notes and ledger it
# brought. A failed build never blocks the checkout (a fresh worktree may not have installed yet).
pnpm backlog:build --quiet >/dev/null || echo "backlog: could not build docs/v3/INDEX.md — run pnpm backlog:build" >&2
